  "id": "postictal",
  "term": "postictal",
  "definition": "Postictal refers to the recovery period after a seizure. In this context, it means a timed state after the seizure in which brain activity, blood-flow and metabolic changes, and early clinical reorientation become organized and recoupled rather than simply stopping the seizure.",
